# Java / Gradle
backend/build/
backend/.gradle/
backend/out/
*.class
*.jar
# The Gradle wrapper jar MUST be committed — without it `./gradlew` cannot bootstrap on a clean
# clone and CI fails on checkout. The leading **/ is load-bearing: a path without it is anchored
# to this file's directory and would not match backend/gradle/wrapper/.
!**/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar

